Third-party components

This repository contains no third-party source code. Dependencies are declared
in `Driftsentry/pyproject.toml`, `Driftsentry/requirements.lock` and
`mcp rug pull attack server/pyproject.toml`, and are installed from PyPI under
their own licences (MIT, Apache-2.0 and BSD-3-Clause).

The sentence embedding model `all-MiniLM-L6-v2` is NOT redistributed here. It is
downloaded on first use by ChromaDB and cached outside this repository. Its
licence is that of its upstream publisher.
